{"3612660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hatters", "steam_appid": 3612660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatters is a cooperative action roguelike bullet hell where magic flies in every direction and laughter is as common as explosions. A light-hearted fantasy adventure for up to four players, where you put on the hats of eccentric wizards and dive into the heart of magical chaos. Every battle is unpredictable thanks to randomly drawn spells, forcing you to improvise on the spot and making each fight uniquely chaotic and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/cfa2ecfca9ab9efd583917c653c438cc.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/cfa2ecfca9ab9efd583917c653c438cc.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/cfa2ecfca9ab9efd583917c653c438cc.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through different levels from mysterious forests to ancient ruins, each with its own style and cunning enemies. A light but engaging story will guide you through the lands of Hatters and reveal what is hidden behind all these hats and why the local mages are so mad. But do not get distracted by the scenery, the next wave of monsters is already rushing to knock the hat off your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect magical artifacts. Each mage can wear up to 10 unique rings with powerful bonuses. Complete the image of a mighty wizard by equipping staves, swords or shields in two equipment slots. Experiment with builds and decide whether you want to become a walking firestorm or an unbreakable living fortress. As you progress, spend gold to unlock 24 talents and adjust your hero to your own playstyle, from a swift fire raider to a cunning master of secret magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters during your journey. Try them all, maybe the crazy pyromancer or the mysterious trickster will become your favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>25 unique spells of five elements: fire, water, earth, air and secret magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/427a7fd9ea9e389ee3243e6bf5501945.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/427a7fd9ea9e389ee3243e6bf5501945.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/427a7fd9ea9e389ee3243e6bf5501945.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cooperative mode for 1 to 4 players.<br>Varied levels with their own enemies and challenges.<br>Up to 10 magical rings and two slots for weapons, shields or staves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>24 talents for character development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>New heroes with unique starting abilities.<br>A light story with humor.<br>Controller and Steam Deck support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to put on your craziest hat and dive into the whirlwind of friendly magical chaos? Welcome to Hatters, where saving the world is fun and magic knows no limits.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatters is a cooperative action roguelike bullet hell where magic flies in every direction and laughter is as common as explosions. A light-hearted fantasy adventure for up to four players, where you put on the hats of eccentric wizards and dive into the heart of magical chaos. Every battle is unpredictable thanks to randomly drawn spells, forcing you to improvise on the spot and making each fight uniquely chaotic and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/cfa2ecfca9ab9efd583917c653c438cc.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/cfa2ecfca9ab9efd583917c653c438cc.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/cfa2ecfca9ab9efd583917c653c438cc.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through different levels from mysterious forests to ancient ruins, each with its own style and cunning enemies. A light but engaging story will guide you through the lands of Hatters and reveal what is hidden behind all these hats and why the local mages are so mad. But do not get distracted by the scenery, the next wave of monsters is already rushing to knock the hat off your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect magical artifacts. Each mage can wear up to 10 unique rings with powerful bonuses. Complete the image of a mighty wizard by equipping staves, swords or shields in two equipment slots. Experiment with builds and decide whether you want to become a walking firestorm or an unbreakable living fortress. As you progress, spend gold to unlock 24 talents and adjust your hero to your own playstyle, from a swift fire raider to a cunning master of secret magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters during your journey. Try them all, maybe the crazy pyromancer or the mysterious trickster will become your favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>25 unique spells of five elements: fire, water, earth, air and secret magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/427a7fd9ea9e389ee3243e6bf5501945.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/427a7fd9ea9e389ee3243e6bf5501945.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/427a7fd9ea9e389ee3243e6bf5501945.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cooperative mode for 1 to 4 players.<br>Varied levels with their own enemies and challenges.<br>Up to 10 magical rings and two slots for weapons, shields or staves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>24 talents for character development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.poster.avif?t=1779736050\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.webm?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612660/extras/4570910f8f652ec78229b543a239bcc6.mp4?t=1779736050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>New heroes with unique starting abilities.<br>A light story with humor.<br>Controller and Steam Deck support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to put on your craziest hat and dive into the whirlwind of friendly magical chaos? Welcome to Hatters, where saving the world is fun and magic knows no limits.</p>", "short_description": "Hatters is a cooperative bullet hell roguelike for up to 4 players. Random spells of five elements, magical artifacts, new heroes and a light sto